# interpolation method: 1 = bilinear (scalar); 11 / 21 = bilinear, U / V vector component
# (EXF's default for the winds is bicubic, 12 / 22; bilinear is used here because these fields have
# land/sea steps and must stay non-negative -- precip, swdown, lwdown, runoff)
